    "重要程度": "Importance",
    "联网搜索实时信息。当用户询问新闻、天气、最新动态、股价、赛事比分，或需要查资料、引用网页内容时调用。返回标题、URL、摘要列表。\n搜索质量提示：本搜索底层是中文市场搜索引擎，对冷门英文技术词相关度差。构造查询时：\n1) 用该主题最常用、最权威、最可能被广泛收录的表述；冷门专业词要补充领域上下文词或知名厂商/平台名。\n2) 有歧义的多义词务必加限定消歧：如查软件应写\"Adobe After Effects\"，避免命中同名电影。\n3) 国际/英文技术主题优先用英文检索，中文主题用中文，避免中英混杂。\n4) 用短小的高信号短语，不要写成整句提问；精确词组可用引号括住。\n5) 若结果不佳，换更通用或加限定词的表述再搜，不要重复同一查询。": "Web search for real-time information. Call it when the user asks about news, weather, current events, stock prices, or match scores, or when you need to look something up or quote web content. Returns titles, URLs, and a summary list.\nSearch quality tips: this search is backed by a Chinese-market search engine and has poor relevance for obscure English technical terms. When building a query:\n1) Use the most common, authoritative, and widely indexed wording for the topic; for niche technical terms, add domain context words or well-known vendor/platform names.\n2) Disambiguate ambiguous terms: to search for software write \"Adobe After Effects\" so you do not hit the movie of the same name.\n3) Prefer English for international or English-language technical topics and Chinese for Chinese topics; do not mix them.\n4) Use short, high-signal phrases instead of full-sentence questions; wrap exact phrases in quotes.\n5) If the results are poor, rephrase with more general wording or add qualifiers instead of repeating the same query.",
    "搜索关键词。请写成高消歧、高信号、面向中文市场引擎的紧凑查询（参考描述中的搜索质量提示）。": "Search keywords. Write a compact, high-signal, low-ambiguity query for a Chinese-market engine (see the search quality tips in the description).",
    "结果数量（默认 5，上限 20）。单页实际 8~10 条，取不到更多；要更多结果请换关键词": "Number of results (default 5, max 20). A page actually returns 8-10 entries, so more cannot be fetched; use different keywords for more results",
    "回忆相关记忆": "Recall related memories",
