    "工具描述，LLM 据此决定何时调用此工具": "Tool description; the LLM uses it to decide when to call this tool",
    "简短描述（最多30字），stub模式下发给LLM的简短说明。留空则自动截断description。如：获取项目信息": "Short description (max 30 characters): the brief text sent to the LLM in stub mode. Leave it empty to truncate the description automatically. Example: get project info",
    "JSON Schema 格式的参数定义，含 type/properties/required": "Parameter definitions in JSON Schema format, including type/properties/required",
    "工具分类，可选值: project, composition, layer, animation, effect, render, utility, custom。默认 custom": "Tool category; one of project, composition, layer, animation, effect, render, utility, custom. Defaults to custom",
    "是否为只读工具。true 时执行不包撤销组（适用于查询类工具），且不影响作用域。默认 false": "Whether the tool is read-only. When true, execution is not wrapped in an undo group (suits query tools) and does not affect scope. Defaults to false",
