    "删除一个 LLM 创建的 AE 工具。只能删除来源为 AI 的工具，无法删除系统工具或用户手动创建的工具。": "Delete an AE tool created by the LLM. Only AI-created tools can be deleted; system tools and tools the user created manually cannot.",
