    "工具查询可用效果时从缓存读取。装了大量插件时首次生成需分批遍历（AE 间歇卡顿），之后秒回。无缓存时 LLM 调用该工具会收到提示而非数据。": "Reads from the cache when the tool queries available effects. With many plug-ins installed, the first generation must traverse them in batches (AE stutters intermittently); later queries return instantly. Without a cache, the LLM receives a prompt instead of data when it calls the tool.",
