    "短描述自动生成": "Short Description Auto-Generation",
    "MCP 服务器连接成功后，自动调用 LLM 为每个工具生成简短中文描述，用于 LLM 快速识别工具用途。配合 Stub 模式可显著节省 Token——LLM 仅看到短描述与空参数表，调用前通过": "After an MCP server connects successfully, an LLM is called automatically to generate a short description for each tool, so the LLM can quickly identify what the tool does. Combined with Stub mode this saves a significant number of tokens: the LLM sees only the short description and an empty parameter table and calls",
    "解锁完整定义。关闭后不再调用 LLM，工具走完整描述与参数注入，Token 消耗更大但无需 search 步骤。": "first to unlock the full definition. When off, no LLM is called; tools use full descriptions and parameter injection, which costs more tokens but skips the search step.",
