    "短描述": "Short Description",
    "：留空将自动生成，用于 LLM 快速识别工具用途。": ": auto-generated when left blank; the LLM uses it to quickly identify what the tool is for.",
    "Stub 模式": "Stub Mode",
    "：开启后 LLM 仅看到短描述与空参数表（调用前需先 tool_search 解锁完整定义），可显著节省 token；关闭则直接注入完整描述与参数。": ": when enabled, the LLM sees only the short description and an empty parameter table (call tool_search first to unlock the full definition), which saves a significant number of tokens; when disabled, the full description and parameters are injected directly.",
