    "点「确定」：立即重载面板（重启后按新数据目录初始化，三库/会话/画布随之切换）。\n点「取消」：暂不重载，面板继续按旧目录读写，稍后可手动重载。\n\n": "Click \"OK\": reload the panel now (after the restart the panel initializes from the new data directory; the three libraries, sessions, and canvas switch with it).\nClick \"Cancel\": do not reload now; the panel keeps reading and writing the old directory, and you can reload manually later.\n\n",
    "检测到：{busy}。点「确定」将立即重载并中断这些任务。": "Detected: {busy}. Click \"OK\" to reload immediately and interrupt these tasks.",
    "该路径不可用作数据目录：{why}。\n\n被拒路径：\n「{path}」\n\n选择此类路径可能导致系统文件被覆盖或用户资料被误删。请选择独立的用户数据目录（如「D:\\AE_Data」）。": "This path cannot be used as the data directory: {why}.\n\nRejected path:\n\"{path}\"\n\nUsing such a path may overwrite system files or delete user data. Choose a dedicated user data directory (for example \"D:\\AE_Data\").",
    "位于系统目录或盘符根目录": "it is a system directory or a drive root",
