    "目标目录与当前数据目录互为父子（{why}），迁移会互相覆盖或递归拷贝，已拒绝。\n\n当前数据目录：\n「{current}」\n\n目标目录：\n「{target}」\n\n请选择独立的用户数据目录（如「D:\\AE_Data」）。": "The target and current data directories are nested inside each other ({why}); migrating would overwrite or recursively copy one into the other, so it was rejected.\n\nCurrent data directory:\n\"{current}\"\n\nTarget directory:\n\"{target}\"\n\nChoose a dedicated user data directory (for example \"D:\\AE_Data\").",
