    "目标目录已存在 AS_ExtP 数据{list}。\n\n继续将先删除目标目录中的现有数据（优先移入回收站；无法移入时将永久删除，不可恢复），再用当前目录「{current}」的数据整份覆盖。\n\n目标路径：\n「{target}」\n\n此操作不可撤销，是否覆盖？": "The target directory already contains AS_ExtP data{list}.\n\nContinuing deletes the existing data in the target directory first (moved to the Recycle Bin when possible; otherwise permanently deleted, which cannot be undone), then overwrites it entirely with data from the current directory \"{current}\".\n\nTarget path:\n\"{target}\"\n\nThis cannot be undone. Overwrite?",
