    "默认情况下，AI 生成的脚本每次运行前都会先询问你。勾选某一项 = 提前授权这一类脚本：以后直接运行，不再逐次询问，并自动放开全部权限。": "By default, AI-generated scripts ask you before every run. Checking an item pre-authorizes that class of scripts: they run directly from then on, without asking each time, and are granted all permissions automatically.",
    "开启后，AI 写的这类脚本会直接运行，不再每次先征求你的同意，并自动拥有全部权限（运行系统命令、联网、读写文件等）。\n\n万一 AI 写出有问题的代码，也可能在你不知情时运行。只有充分信任当前使用的 AI 模型时才建议开启。\n\n最危险的写法和系统关键位置仍会被强制拦截，但不应依赖这层保护。": "Once enabled, scripts of this class written by the AI run directly without asking each time and are automatically granted all permissions (running system commands, network access, file reads and writes, and so on).\n\nIf the AI writes broken code, it may also run without your knowledge. Enable this only when you fully trust the AI model in use.\n\nThe most dangerous constructs and critical system locations are still blocked, but do not rely on that protection.",
