    "[AE_LLM] executeExtendScript 拒绝：代码含沙箱逃逸/系统调用/网络通信/延迟执行/实例危险操作标识符（_cs/__ael/__aeS*/$.evalFile/$.global/callSystem/BridgeTalk/Socket/scheduleTask/runScriptFromFile/_File/_Folder/_ef/_bt/_sk/_st/_gFile/_gFolder/_gBT/_alert/_confirm/_prompt/caller/callee/.execute(/.changePath(/.constructor/__proto__/引擎内部名（_isSensitivePath/_isSystemOrRootDir/_GateFile/_fpo/_authFrame 等，完整名单见引擎侧 _INTERNAL_NAMES）/.getFiles()[）。Socket 是完整 TCP 通道（数据外泄/伪造 bridge 请求），默认无条件禁项（经 allow-set 受控放行——user-library 审计确认或能力域授权）。app.scheduleTask 回调在 shadow 恢复后执行（延迟绕过双层沙箱），禁止调用（硬拒无通道）。runScriptFromFile 在 host.jsx 顶层作用域 eval 文件内容，shadow 沙箱对其无效——禁止调用。File/Folder 实例的 execute()（启动任意可执行文件）一律拒绝；changePath()（真实例改指任意路径，敏感读取链一环）一律拒绝；Folder.getFiles()[ 立即索引形态默认拒绝（file 域授权后放行——静态访问器与 getFiles 返回条目按域分粒度包装）。如需 system.callSystem 等 capability 能力，请在「Agent 模块设置 > AST 门能力配置」开启对应能力域（或通道信任）。": "[AE_LLM] executeExtendScript refused: the code contains sandbox-escape / system-call / network / deferred-execution / dangerous-instance identifiers (_cs/__ael/__aeS*/$.evalFile/$.global/callSystem/BridgeTalk/Socket/scheduleTask/runScriptFromFile/_File/_Folder/_ef/_bt/_sk/_st/_gFile/_gFolder/_gBT/_alert/_confirm/_prompt/caller/callee/.execute(/.changePath(/.constructor/__proto__/engine internal names (_isSensitivePath/_isSystemOrRootDir/_GateFile/_fpo/_authFrame and others; the full list is _INTERNAL_NAMES on the engine side)/.getFiles()[). Socket is a full TCP channel (data exfiltration / forged bridge requests) and is denied unconditionally by default (released only through an allow-set — a user-library audit acknowledgement or a capability-domain grant). app.scheduleTask callbacks run after the shadow is restored (a deferred bypass of both sandbox layers), so the call is denied (hard refusal, no channel). runScriptFromFile evals file content in the host.jsx top-level scope, where the shadow sandbox has no effect — the call is denied. File/Folder instance execute() (launching any executable) is always refused; changePath() (re-pointing a real instance to an arbitrary path, one link of the sensitive-read chain) is always refused; the Folder.getFiles()[ immediate-index form is refused by default (released once the file domain is granted — static accessors and getFiles entries are wrapped per domain at their own granularity). To use capability features such as system.callSystem, enable the corresponding capability domain (or channel trust) in \"Agent module settings > AST gate capability configuration\".",
    "[AE_LLM] runScriptSandboxed 拒绝执行：脚本含沙箱逃逸/系统调用/网络通信/延迟执行/实例危险操作标识符（__ael/__aeS/_OF/_OD/$.evalFile/$.global/callSystem/BridgeTalk/Socket/scheduleTask/runScriptFromFile/.execute(/.changePath(/.getFiles()[）。热盒脚本一律沙箱执行（hotbox scripts are always sandboxed）：system.callSystem/BridgeTalk/Socket 即使经字符串拼接绕过本预检，运行时 shadow 也会以 System call disabled / BridgeTalk disabled / Socket disabled 拦截。app.scheduleTask 可在 shadow 恢复后延迟执行任意代码（时间窗绕过双层防线），禁止调用；脚本自带撤销组（beginUndoGroup/endUndoGroup）不再拦截——检测到即跳过框架外层包裹，撤销语义由脚本自负。File/Folder 实例的 execute()（启动任意可执行文件）一律拒绝；changePath()（真实例改指任意路径，敏感读取链一环）一律拒绝；Folder.getFiles()[ 立即索引形态拒绝——Folder.temp 等静态访问器与 getFiles 返回条目已包装为只读安全实例（写/删/改名/复制/执行拦截，读放行）。": "[AE_LLM] runScriptSandboxed refused: the script contains sandbox-escape / system-call / network / deferred-execution / dangerous-instance identifiers (__ael/__aeS/_OF/_OD/$.evalFile/$.global/callSystem/BridgeTalk/Socket/scheduleTask/runScriptFromFile/.execute(/.changePath(/.getFiles()[). Hotbox scripts are always sandboxed: even when string concatenation slips past this pre-check, the runtime shadow still blocks system.callSystem/BridgeTalk/Socket with System call disabled / BridgeTalk disabled / Socket disabled. app.scheduleTask can defer execution of arbitrary code until after the shadow is restored (a time-window bypass of both defence layers), so it must not be called; a script that brings its own undo group (beginUndoGroup/endUndoGroup) is no longer blocked — when detected, the framework skips its outer wrapper and the undo semantics are the script's own responsibility. File/Folder instance execute() (launching any executable) is always refused; changePath() (re-pointing a real instance to an arbitrary path, one link of the sensitive-read chain) is always refused; the Folder.getFiles()[ immediate-index form is refused — Folder.temp and other static accessors plus getFiles entries are already wrapped as read-only safe instances (write/delete/rename/copy/execute blocked, reads allowed).",
