    "获取 After Effects 当前活动合成的预览帧截图。单时间点（timeInSeconds）返回一张 PNG；多时间点（timesInSeconds，2–6 个）逐帧抓取后合成一张带时间标签的联系表，用于检查动画连续性、出场层次、形变是否连贯。截图会自动注入上下文供视觉分析。核对局部细节（文字、UI、边缘）时传 region 或 zoom：注入的是裁切放大图，整帧仍在 fullFramePath（单帧）或 frames[].filePath（多帧）。回执带解析出的 compositionId 与 compName；compName 命中多个同名合成时返回 error 与 matchedCompositionIds，改用 compositionId 指定目标（不静默取首个）。timeInSeconds 越界钳制到 [0, duration]，此时回执带 timeClamped=true 与 requestedAt。": "Capture a preview frame of After Effects' active composition. A single time point (timeInSeconds) returns one PNG; several time points (timesInSeconds, 2–6) capture frames one by one and compose a contact sheet with time labels, used to check animation continuity, entrance layering and morph smoothness. The screenshot is injected into the context automatically for visual analysis. To inspect local detail (text, UI, edges) pass region or zoom: the injected image is the cropped and enlarged one, while the full frame stays in fullFramePath (single frame) or frames[].filePath (multiple frames). The receipt carries the resolved compositionId and compName; when compName matches several compositions of the same name, error is returned with matchedCompositionIds — specify the target with compositionId instead (the first match is never taken silently). timeInSeconds outside the range is clamped to [0, duration]; the receipt then carries timeClamped=true and requestedAt.",
